\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Annual Matched Flash-Flood Frequency vs NOAA-Reported Financial Damage: Compares the number of high-confidence matched floods in each year with total NOAA-reported damage. Higher annual event frequency does not consistently correspond to higher annual financial losses.\
