\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Percentage of NOAA Flash-Flood Events Corroborated by Groundsource by Match Confidence: Compares strict High-confidence corroboration rates with broader High + Medium rates, showing the tradeoff between stronger match certainty and greater coverage.\
